  m_text: "Targeted marketing is another major benefit of data mining, as it helps
    businesses reach customers who are most likely to make a purchase. Personalized
    promotions based on mining customer data often lead to higher conversion rates
    and increased revenue. \nData mining also assists in detecting fraud or inefficient
    processes that may be draining profits. By identifying customers at risk of leaving,
    companies can take proactive steps to increase retention and lifetime value. "
