  m_text: "consequences, making them easy to interpret and understand.\n\n Decision
    trees are also widely used in data mining as they provide a visual representation
    of decisions and their possible consequences, making them easy to interpret and
    understand.\n\nMore complex techniques like neural networks are used to identify
    intricate patterns in data, especially in areas such as image and speech recognition.
    Anomaly detection, another critical method, helps identify outliers or unusual
    data points that do not conform to the expected patterns, often highlighting
    errors or rare events.\n\nText mining, which focuses on extracting useful information
    from unstructured text data, is especially valuable in analyzing customer reviews,
    news articles, and social media posts.\nFinally, dimensionality reduction techniques,
    such as "
