  m_text: 'Data mining helps businesses maximize profits by uncovering patterns in
    customer purchasing behavior. Companies can use these insights to identify which
    products are most likely to sell and when demand will increase. By analyzing
    historical sales data, organizations can improve inventory management and reduce
    unnecessary stock costs. Data mining also helps refine pricing strategies by
    revealing how customers respond to different price points. '
